WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.069
SHAQ:<i> People always say,
 "What do you want
 your legacy to be?"</i>

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.105
I wanna be known as
one of the greats.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.041
ANNOUNCER:
<i> Meet Shaquille O'Neal.</i>

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:09.075
SHAQ: What's up, baby?

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.409
My momma always used to say...

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:11.845
Something special
about that one.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:15.181
SHAQ:<i> Take you back.
 Thirteen years old, 6'9.</i>

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:18.117
<i>There was a guy who says,
"You're 6'9 and you can't dunk."</i>

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:20.019
I gave him the beatdown
of his life.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.956
At that point, I was dreaming
about being a rapper.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.423
I was dreaming about
being a basketball player.

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:26.425
I was just dreaming about
being rich.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:29.161
LUCILLE O'NEAL:<i> I think
what carries him is the support</i>

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:30.963
that he always got from family.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.264
SHAQ:<i> My father always told me,</i>

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:33.966
"I'm gonna make you better
than I was."

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.034
I love you, boy!

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.337
My dad would always tell us,
"Y'all might hate my ways..."

00:00:38.404 --> 00:00:39.372
"But you love my results."

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.141
SHAQ:<i> His words.
 "If you listen to me,</i>

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.676
<i>I'll make you one of the best
basketball players ever."</i>

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:45.311
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.613
<i>When I won the championship,
 my father says,</i>

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.583
<i>"You know how we roll, brother.
 Go get another one."</i>

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.384
Yes, sir.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.487
SPEAKER:<i> When he wants to
 take over a game,</i>

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.222
<i> with his strength
 and athleticism,</i>

00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:57.190
there's nothing you can do.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.626
Shaq is legitimately
one of the best centers

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.994
that the NBA had ever seen.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.895
He was like 373 pounds.

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:03.996
<i> He's a big guy.</i>

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.832
SHAQ:<i> Because of my size,
they had to get super physical.</i>

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:08.901
<i> But my superpower
 is getting mad.</i>

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:10.636
<i>When I get mad, it's over.</i>

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.506
♪<i> Show you no mercy
 Yeah, show me respect</i> ♪

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.442
SPEAKER 2:<i> He was so dominant,
 so quick,</i>

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.811
<i> but he was playful
 and full of love.</i>

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.012
<i>♪ Who going harder than me? ♪</i>

00:01:20.112 --> 00:01:21.047
You know, until he's not.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.749
SHAQ:
<i>When people start talking...</i>

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.085
Those are words that
I'll punch you in your face for.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.519
SPEAKER 3:
<i> When you're at the top,</i>

00:01:27.686 --> 00:01:30.523
<i>little chinks in your armor
 that are underneath,</i>

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.458
everybody gets to look up
at those for longer.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.360
 SHAQ:<i> I was under
 the most pressure.</i>

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.828
I'm still dealing with it.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.030
<i> ♪ Who got the heart
 Of the king? ♪</i>

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:39.131
<i>I like making people laugh.</i>

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:42.134
<i>My mission in life now is to
just brighten up peoples' day.</i>

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.170
SPEAKER 4:
<i>He chooses to just be fun.</i>

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.907
<i>Let Shaquille be Shaquille,
 and the magic will come.</i>

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:49.075
Stop.

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:50.276
Just shoot the money, brother.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:53.313
I always take advantage
of opportunities.

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.181
<i>I want to make so much money
 on the side.</i>

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.649
DWAYNE WADE:
<i> His message to me was,
"Whatever you're gonna do,</i>

00:01:57.716 --> 00:01:59.518
it's your brand,
so make sure it's your voice."

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.120
Black Friedrich Nietzsche
over here.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.388
I really am the man.

00:02:02.721 --> 00:02:05.325
He presented an example
of how to brand yourself
beyond the game.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.627
<i> You can't open your eyes
 and not see him.</i>

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.864
When a father's quizzing his son
on great, big men of the game...

00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:15.502
<i>hopefully Shaquille O'Neal's
name will be in the answer.</i>

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:18.438
<i>♪ Who going harder than me? ♪</i>

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:20.440
<i> ♪ Nobody ♪</i>

